  "summary": "Browse the workspace, upload and download, preview images and video",
  "description": "A small purpose-built file browser for the workstation volume. Paths are confined with os.Root so a request cannot escape the workspace even through a symlink, and only images, video, audio, and plain text are served inline; everything else downloads, so workspace content cannot execute against the controller origin.",
